I put the jboselkei back online at http://lojban.qx11.info/jboselkei/ . I 
received the database with the old posts, translations, and user info so 
those of you who already had accounts should be able to log in with your 
old password. Everything seems to be working just fine, but if anyone comes 
across any problems, or has any suggestions, e-mail me at x@qx11.info . 
Someone already suggested that I allow people to get a list of posts and 
translations to translate or review instead of having to go through a 
queue, so I'm working on some code to add that feature but that will 
probably take a few days.

